# 📝 TOEIC Part 5 - Day34

## Question 1

The presentation was very _____.

A. interested
B. interesting
C. interest
D. interests

Answer: B

→ 발표가 흥미를 유발
→ interesting

---

## Question 2

The employees were _____ by the unexpected announcement.

A. surprising
B. surprised
C. surprise
D. surprisingly

Answer: B

→ 직원들이 놀람을 느낌
→ surprised

---

## Question 3

The company purchased _____ equipment for the laboratory.

A. advanced
B. advancing
C. advance
D. advances

Answer: A

→ equipment를 수식하는 형용사
→ advanced equipment

---

## Question 4

The instructions were so _____ that several employees made mistakes.

A. confused
B. confusing
C. confuse
D. confusion

Answer: B

→ 지침이 사람을 혼란스럽게 함
→ confusing

---

## Challenge

The customers were _____ with the service provided by the company.

A. satisfying
B. satisfaction
C. satisfied
D. satisfy

Answer: C

→ 고객이 만족을 느낌
→ satisfied

---

## Key Point

### -ing

감정을 일으키는 대상

interesting
exciting
confusing
boring
surprising

### -ed

감정을 느끼는 사람

interested
excited
confused
bored
surprised

---

## 기억하기

The movie is boring.

I am bored.

The news is surprising.

I am surprised.
